WEBVTT

00:00:13.311 --> 00:00:17.691
The one with the power
to vanquish the Dark Lord approaches.

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:20.944
And the Dark Lord
shall mark him as his equal...

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:23.947
...but he shall have power
the Dark Lord knows not.

00:00:29.578 --> 00:00:33.268
For neither can live
while the other survives.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.545
Harry.

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:50.515
Where's Sirius?

00:00:50.682 --> 00:00:54.750
You know, you really should learn
to tell the difference between dreams...

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.859
...and reality.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:05.993
You saw only what the Dark Lord
wanted you to see.

00:01:07.782 --> 00:01:09.284
Now, hand me the prophecy.

00:01:09.492 --> 00:01:11.536
If you do anything to us, I'll break it.

00:01:14.289 --> 00:01:16.205
He knows how to play.

00:01:16.682 --> 00:01:19.777
Itty, bitty baby.

00:01:21.004 --> 00:01:22.255
Potter.

00:01:22.797 --> 00:01:24.084
Bellatrix Lestrange.

00:01:24.841 --> 00:01:27.802
Neville Longbottom, is it?
How's Mum and Dad?

00:01:28.011 --> 00:01:29.804
Better, now they're about to be avenged.

00:01:32.641 --> 00:01:37.520
Now, let's everybody just calm down...

00:01:37.937 --> 00:01:39.439
...shall we?

00:01:39.606 --> 00:01:42.067
All we want is that prophecy.

00:01:42.233 --> 00:01:44.277
Why did Voldemort
need me to come and get this?

00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:45.787
You dare speak his name?

00:01:47.781 --> 00:01:49.366
You filthy half-blood!

00:01:49.532 --> 00:01:51.810
It's all right.
He's just a curious lad, aren't you?

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:58.482
Prophecies can only be retrieved
by those about whom they are made.

00:01:59.709 --> 00:02:01.902
Which is lucky for you, really.

00:02:06.216 --> 00:02:08.176
Haven't you always wondered...

00:02:08.677 --> 00:02:13.418
...what was the reason for the connection
between you and the Dark Lord?

00:02:14.599 --> 00:02:16.552
Why he was unable to kill you...

00:02:17.268 --> 00:02:19.403
...when you were just an infant?

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:25.345
Don't you want to know
the secret of your scar?

00:02:26.903 --> 00:02:30.634
All the answers are there, Potter,
in your hand.

00:02:32.575 --> 00:02:33.997
All you have to do...

00:02:35.078 --> 00:02:36.380
...is give it to me.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.515
Then I can show you everything.

00:02:49.384 --> 00:02:51.177
I've waited 14 years.

00:02:51.761 --> 00:02:53.096
I know.

00:02:54.389 --> 00:02:57.308
I guess I can wait a little longer.
Now. Stupefy.

00:02:57.475 --> 00:02:58.893
Stupefy.

00:03:15.034 --> 00:03:16.119
Levicorpus.

00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:24.627
Petrificus Totalus.

00:03:24.794 --> 00:03:26.629
Well done, Neville.

00:03:35.054 --> 00:03:36.639
Stupefy.

00:03:38.349 --> 00:03:39.642
-Stupefy.
-Stupefy.

00:03:50.737 --> 00:03:52.655
Stupefy.

00:04:00.163 --> 00:04:02.457
Reducto.

00:04:18.473 --> 00:04:19.736
Get back to the door.

00:04:55.885 --> 00:04:59.370
Department of Mysteries.
They got that bit right, didn't they?

00:05:05.603 --> 00:05:06.782
The voices.

00:05:08.064 --> 00:05:09.428
Can you tell what they're saying?

00:05:11.776 --> 00:05:13.215
There aren't any voices, Harry.

00:05:14.737 --> 00:05:16.447
Let's get out of here.

00:05:16.614 --> 00:05:17.691
I hear them too.

00:05:21.327 --> 00:05:23.375
Harry, it's just an empty archway.

00:05:26.749 --> 00:05:28.126
Please, Harry.

00:05:28.877 --> 00:05:30.263
Get behind me.

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.131
Did you actually believe...

00:06:20.248 --> 00:06:23.777
...or were you truly naive enough
to think...

00:06:25.391 --> 00:06:30.081
...that children stood a chance
against us?

00:06:34.025 --> 00:06:37.260
I'll make this simple for you, Potter.

00:06:41.449 --> 00:06:43.746
Give me the prophecy now...

00:06:44.953 --> 00:06:48.577
...or watch your friends die.

00:07:01.886 --> 00:07:03.346
-Don't give it to him, Harry.
-Shh!

